        "text": "Spack developers <https:\/\/github.com\/spack\/spack\/issues\/41953|are unhappy about> `Sys.which` containing a hard-coded path to where `which` was at `configure` time because this breaks Spack package relocation. This prompted a patch <https:\/\/github.com\/r-devel\/r-svn\/pull\/151|in early 2024> and <https:\/\/stat.ethz.ch\/pipermail\/r-devel\/2024-January\/083113.html|some discussion>. Unfortunately, `command -v`, which is in POSIX, does almost but not quite the same thing and so cannot properly replace `which` for R's purposes.",
